#: templates/static/compare_feedbin.xhtml:130
msgid ""
"NewsBlur and Feedbin are both independent, privacy-respecting RSS readers built by small teams. They share "
"a commitment to open source and a belief that RSS should be simple and user-controlled. The key difference "
"is depth: Feedbin focuses on a clean, minimal reading experience. NewsBlur adds intelligence training, AI "
"features, social sharing, and native mobile apps on top of a similarly clean interface. If you want the "
"simplest possible reader, Feedbin is excellent. If you want more power without sacrificing usability, "
"NewsBlur delivers."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur 和 Feedbin 都是由小团队打造的独立 RSS 阅读器，尊重用户隐私。它们都致力于开源，并坚信 RSS 应该简单且由用户掌控。两者的关键区别在于功能深度：Feedbin "
"专注于简洁、精简的阅读体验。NewsBlur 则在同样简洁的界面上，加入了智能训练、AI 功能、社交分享和原生移动应用。如果你想要尽可能简单的阅读器，Feedbin "
"非常出色。如果你想获得更多功能而不牺牲易用性，NewsBlur 值得选择。"

#: templates/static/compare_feedbin.xhtml:144
msgid ""
"NewsBlur builds and maintains its own native iOS and Android apps with full feature parity, including "
"intelligence training, blurblog sharing, and text view. Feedbin relies entirely on third-party apps like "
"Reeder and NetNewsWire. Both approaches work, but NewsBlur's native apps mean every feature is available on"
" mobile from day one, without waiting for a third-party developer to add support."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur 自行开发并维护原生 iOS 和 Android 应用，功能完全一致，包括智能训练、blurblog 分享和文本视图。Feedbin 则完全依赖 Reeder 和 NetNewsWire "
"等第三方应用。两种方式都可行，但 NewsBlur 的原生应用从一开始就能在移动设备上提供所有功能，无需等待第三方开发者添加支持。"

#: templates/static/press.xhtml:451
msgid "NewsBlur bukan sebarang pembaca suapan RSS"
msgstr "NewsBlur 并非普通的 RSS 阅读器"

#: templates/404.html:68
msgid "NewsBlur can't find that page"
msgstr "NewsBlur 找不到该页面"

#: templates/static/about.xhtml:146
msgid ""
"NewsBlur continues to evolve with AI-powered features, daily briefings, and intelligence training that gets"
" smarter over time. Still independent, still open source, still built for readers who care about the news."
msgstr "NewsBlur 持续进化，带来 AI 驱动的功能、每日简报，以及会随时间不断变得更聪明的智能训练。我们依然独立，依然开源，依然为关心新闻的读者打造。"

#: templates/static/privacy.xhtml:55
msgid ""
"NewsBlur displays links and content from third-party feeds and sites, and downloads images directly from "
"each sites’ third-party servers. These have their own independent privacy policies, and we have no "
"responsibility or liability for their content or activities."
msgstr "NewsBlur 会显示第三方订阅源和网站的链接与内容，并直接从各网站的第三方服务器下载图片。这些网站各自有独立的隐私政策，我们对其内容或活动不承担任何责任。"

#: templates/reader/welcome.xhtml:785
msgid ""
"NewsBlur emerges as by far the best, and better designed in a lot of ways both large and small. It "
"dominates all the Google Reader alternatives."
msgstr "NewsBlur 脱颖而出，远胜其他产品，在许多方面无论大小都设计得更好。它在所有 Google Reader 替代品中占据主导地位。"

#: templates/static/press.xhtml:610
msgid "NewsBlur est le lecteur RSS choisi intelligemment vos flux"
msgstr "NewsBlur 是您的智能 RSS 阅读器，可为您挑选订阅源"

#: templates/500.html:65
msgid "NewsBlur experienced an error"
msgstr "NewsBlur 遇到错误"

#: templates/static/alt_inoreader.xhtml:27
msgid ""
"NewsBlur gives you intelligence training to control your reading, AI-powered summaries, native mobile apps,"
" and full open source transparency. Switching takes less than a minute."
msgstr "NewsBlur 为你提供智能训练，帮助你掌控阅读体验；还有 AI 摘要、原生移动应用和完全开放的源代码。切换只需不到一分钟。"

#: templates/static/alt_feedly.xhtml:27
msgid ""
"NewsBlur gives you more control over your reading, costs less, and is fully open source. Switching takes "
"less than a minute."
msgstr "NewsBlur 让你更好地掌控阅读，价格更低，而且完全开源。切换只需不到一分钟。"

#: templates/reader/welcome.xhtml:1691
msgid ""
"NewsBlur gives you personal training instead of rules, built-in AI features, story clustering, and a fully "
"open source codebase you can self-host."
msgstr "NewsBlur 提供个性化训练而非规则、内置 AI 功能、故事聚类，以及可自行托管的完全开源代码库。"

#: templates/reader/welcome.xhtml:835
msgid "NewsBlur had the poweruser features I wanted. Much better experience than I had with Feedly and Inoreader."
msgstr "NewsBlur 提供了我想要的高级功能。体验比我使用 Feedly 和 Inoreader 时好得多。"

#: templates/static/alt_google_reader.xhtml:73
msgid ""
"NewsBlur has been running continuously since 2009. That's over fifteen years of uptime, development, and "
"community trust. It survived the Google Reader shutdown, the rise and fall of social media as a news "
"source, and the ongoing consolidation of the web. Through all of it, NewsBlur has stayed independent, open "
"source, and focused on one thing: giving you the best way to read the news."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur 自 2009 年起持续运行，至今已超过十五年，始终保持在线、持续开发，并赢得社区信任。它经受住了 Google Reader "
"关闭、社交媒体作为新闻来源的兴衰，以及网络持续整合带来的变化。在这一切之中，NewsBlur 始终保持独立、开源，并专注于一件事：为你提供最佳的新闻阅读方式。"

#: templates/reader/welcome.xhtml:1507
msgid "NewsBlur has filled the Google Reader-sized hole in my heart."
msgstr "NewsBlur 填补了我心中 Google Reader 留下的空缺。"

#: templates/static/alt_inoreader.xhtml:61
msgid ""
"NewsBlur has native iOS and Android apps built and maintained alongside the web app. Every feature, "
"including intelligence training, blurblog sharing, text view, and dark mode, works on mobile. NewsBlur also"
" works with third-party apps like Reeder, ReadKit, Unread, and NetNewsWire. You get the best of both "
"worlds: first-party apps with full features and third-party app compatibility through a standard API."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur 提供原生 iOS 和 Android 应用，并与网页版同步开发和维护。包括智能训练、模糊博客分享、文本视图和深色模式在内的所有功能均可在移动设备上使用。NewsBlur 也兼容 "
"Reeder、ReadKit、Unread 和 NetNewsWire 等第三方应用。您可兼得两全之美：功能齐全的官方应用，以及通过标准 API 实现的第三方应用兼容性。"

#: templates/static/compare_the_old_reader.xhtml:144
msgid ""
"NewsBlur has native iOS and Android apps, plus full sync with popular third-party readers like Reeder, "
"ReadKit, Unread, and NetNewsWire. The Old Reader is primarily a web application with limited third-party "
"integration. For mobile reading, NewsBlur provides a significantly better experience with native apps built"
" specifically for each platform."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur 提供原生 iOS 和 Android 应用，还可与 Reeder、ReadKit、Unread 和 NetNewsWire 等热门第三方阅读器完整同步。The Old Reader 主要是一个 "
"Web 应用，与第三方应用的集成有限。移动阅读方面，NewsBlur 体验要好得多，它为各个平台专门打造了原生应用。"

#: templates/reader/welcome.xhtml:1567
msgid ""
"NewsBlur has newsletters, affordable subscription, nice layout, save to Pocket, just generally has a nice "
"attitude."
msgstr "NewsBlur 有新闻简报、价格实惠的订阅、漂亮的版面、可保存到 Pocket，而且整体体验很棒。"

#: templates/static/features.xhtml:412
msgid "NewsBlur iOS app on iPad showing the dashboard"
msgstr "NewsBlur iPad 上显示控制面板的 iOS 应用"

#: templates/static/features.xhtml:335
msgid "NewsBlur in dark mode showing the full interface"
msgstr "NewsBlur 深色模式下的完整界面"

#: templates/static/alt_open_source.xhtml:145
msgid ""
"NewsBlur includes native iOS and Android apps built in-house. The other open source readers rely on third-"
"party clients via API compatibility layers. NewsBlur also lets you forward email newsletters into your feed"
" reader and follow websites that don't have RSS at all using web feeds. These features are built into the "
"hosted service and the self-hosted version alike."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur 提供自主开发的原生 iOS 和 Android 应用。其他开源阅读器则通过 API 兼容层依赖第三方客户端。NewsBlur 还支持将电子邮件简报转发到阅读器，并通过网络订阅源关注没有 RSS "
"的网站。这些功能在托管服务和自托管版本中均内置提供。"

#: templates/reader/welcome.xhtml:1263
msgid "NewsBlur is a game-changer. Sleek interface, incredibly intuitive features."
msgstr "NewsBlur 彻底改变了游戏规则。界面简洁，功能直观易用。"

#: templates/reader/welcome.xhtml:1173
msgid ""
"NewsBlur is a home of free speech, allowing users in countries with censored news outlets to bypass "
"restrictions and get access to the world at large."
msgstr "NewsBlur 是言论自由的家园，让身处新闻媒体受审查国家的用户能够绕过限制，了解更广阔的世界。"

#: templates/static/contact.xhtml:15
msgid "NewsBlur is a news reader and aggregator developed by Samuel Clay at NewsBlur, Inc."
msgstr "NewsBlur 是一款新闻阅读器和聚合器，由 Samuel Clay 在 NewsBlur 公司开发。"

#: templates/static/press.xhtml:243
msgid "NewsBlur is a slick, impressive, undocumented RSS reader"
msgstr "NewsBlur 是一款精致出色、却没有文档的 RSS 阅读器"

#: templates/static/press.xhtml:218
msgid "NewsBlur is a slick, new RSS reader that intelligently makes sense out of your feeds."
msgstr "NewsBlur 是一款流畅的新 RSS 阅读器，能智能理解你的订阅源内容。"

#: templates/reader/welcome.xhtml:1597
msgid "NewsBlur is awesome and I’m very grateful to you for creating and running it!"
msgstr "NewsBlur 太棒了！非常感谢你创建并运营它！"

#: templates/reader/welcome.xhtml:859
msgid ""
"NewsBlur is deceptively sophisticated. After selecting your preferences, it becomes a super helpful tool "
"for accessing only the content you find most valuable."
msgstr "NewsBlur 看似简单，实则功能强大。选择偏好后，它会成为一个非常实用的工具，帮您只获取最有价值的内容。"

#: templates/502.html:68
msgid "NewsBlur is down"
msgstr "NewsBlur 已宕机"

#: templates/reader/welcome.xhtml:575
msgid "NewsBlur is everything Google Reader should have been."
msgstr "NewsBlur 就是 Google Reader 本该有的样子。"

#: templates/reader/welcome.xhtml:414
msgid ""
"NewsBlur is free on the web, iPad, iPhone, and Android. By subscribing to a premium account, you support a "
"growing service and unlock a few restrictions."
msgstr "NewsBlur 可在网页、iPad、iPhone 和 Android 上免费使用。订阅高级账户，既能支持这项不断发展的服务，也能解锁一些限制。"

#: templates/static/alt_google_reader.xhtml:56
msgid ""
"NewsBlur is fully open source under the MIT license. The entire codebase, including the web app, iOS app, "
"Android app, and all backend services, is available on GitHub. You can inspect it, contribute to it, or run"
" your own self-hosted instance with Docker. Even if NewsBlur the service were to stop operating, the "
"software would live on. Your reading workflow is never at the mercy of a single company's quarterly "
"earnings call."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur 在 MIT 许可证下完全开源。整个代码库，包括 Web 应用、iOS 应用、Android 应用和所有后端服务，均可在 GitHub 上获取。你可以查看代码、参与贡献，也可以通过 Docker "
"运行自己的自托管实例。即使 NewsBlur 服务停止运营，这款软件也会继续存在。你的阅读流程永远不会受制于某一家公司的季度财报电话会议。"

