#: templates/static/api.xhtml:132
msgid ""
"NewsBlur's API allows users to retrieve their feeds, feed counts, feed icons, feed statistics, and "
"individual feed stories. No API key is required, but you are required to authenticate before using any of "
"the API endpoints. Please be considerate, and don't hammer our servers."
msgstr "NewsBlur 的 API 允许用户获取其信息源、信息源计数、信息源图标、信息源统计数据以及单篇文章。无需 API 密钥，但必须先通过身份验证才能使用任何 API 端点。请合理使用，不要给我们的服务器造成过大负担。"

#: templates/static/alt_inoreader.xhtml:47
msgid ""
"NewsBlur's Ask AI feature lets you query any story using Claude, GPT, Gemini, or Grok. Summarize articles, "
"ask follow-up questions, extract key points, or get context on topics you're unfamiliar with. Daily AI "
"briefings give you an overview of what matters across all your feeds. These features are included in the "
"Archive plan at $99/year, which is less than Inoreader's Pro plan at $99.99/year."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur 的 Ask AI 功能可让你使用 Claude、GPT、Gemini 或 Grok 查询任意文章。总结文章、提出后续问题、提取要点，或了解不熟悉主题的背景信息。每日 AI "
"简报可概览所有订阅源中的重要内容。这些功能包含在 Archive 套餐中，价格为每年 99 美元，低于 Inoreader 每年 99.99 美元的 Pro 套餐。"

#: templates/static/compare_feedbin.xhtml:137
msgid ""
"NewsBlur's intelligence training lets you highlight or hide stories based on author, tag, title keywords, "
"full text content, URLs, and regex patterns. Over time, your feeds become personalized. Stories are color-"
"coded green (focus), yellow (neutral), and red (hidden). Feedbin has no equivalent filtering system. You "
"manage reading through folders, tags, and manual triage. For high-volume reading across hundreds of feeds, "
"NewsBlur's training is a major advantage."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur 的智能训练可让您根据作者、标签、标题关键词、全文内容、URL "
"和正则表达式模式来突出显示或隐藏文章。随着时间推移，您的订阅源会逐渐个性化。文章以颜色区分：绿色（重点关注）、黄色（中性）和红色（隐藏）。Feedbin "
"没有同等的筛选系统。您需要通过文件夹、标签和手动筛选来管理阅读。对于需要阅读数百个订阅源的大量内容，NewsBlur 的训练功能是一大优势。"

#: templates/static/compare_readwise.xhtml:132
msgid ""
"NewsBlur's intelligence training system lets you highlight or hide stories based on author, tag, title "
"keywords, full text content, URLs, and regex patterns. Over time, your feeds become personalized without "
"any algorithmic black box. Readwise Reader has no equivalent system. You manage your reading through manual"
" triage, filters, and folder organization. For high-volume reading across hundreds of feeds, NewsBlur's "
"training is a significant advantage."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur 的智能训练系统可让你根据作者、标签、标题关键词、全文内容、网址和正则表达式模式来突出显示或隐藏文章。随着时间推移，你的信息源会变得个性化，而无需依赖任何算法黑箱。Readwise Reader "
"没有同类功能。你需要通过手动筛选、过滤器和文件夹整理来管理阅读内容。对于需要阅读数百个信息源的大量内容的用户，NewsBlur 的训练功能具有显著优势。"

